// A STATEFUL singleton op called BEFORE its handler's install has
// executed. THE STATIC VERDICT LANDED 2026-09-27: the executable root
// gate reads the row alone — main's row carries Counter because early()
// performs it outside the only install — and the program refuses before a
// byte of WAT (E_EffectUnhandled naming Counter). This fixture pinned the
// runtime belt (exit 134) for as long as the gate cleared a name because
